    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      185.49,
      203.45,
      378.21,
      227.39
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MALAIYAGHA STUDENTHIGHER EDUCATION FUND",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      241.49,
      401.9,
      316.31
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a foundation called and known as the\u201cMalaiyagha Student Higher Education Fund\u201d heretoforebeen formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout and transacting all subjects and matters connected withthe said foundation according to the rules agreed by itsmembers:",
    "fonts": [
      "NewYork",
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      330.41,
      401.9,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the objects and mattersfor which it was formed and has applied to incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant the application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      393.89,
      401.89,
      417.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      431.93,
      401.86,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Malaiyagha Student",
    "fonts": [
      "NewYork",
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      444.65,
      401.85,
      455.99
    ],
    "text": "Higher Education Fund (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "NewYork",
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      470.09,
      401.87,
      494.15
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after commencement of this Act, such and somany persons as are members of the Corporation \u201cMalaiyagha",
    "fonts": [
      "NewYork",
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      495.53,
      401.87,
      544.91
    ],
    "text": "Student Higher Education Fund\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cFund\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members of thecorporation hereby constituted shall be a body corporate withperpetual succession under the name and style of \u2018\u2018Malaiyagha",
    "fonts": [
      "NewYork",
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      546.29,
      401.88,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "Student Higher Education Fund\u2019\u2019 (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued andhave full power and authority to have and use a common sealand alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "NewYork",
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      609.77,
      401.88,
      633.83
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Fund is constitutedare hereby declared to be:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      647.93,
      401.89,
      672.23
    ],
